ed that on there - BAM done. Takes a Crafts roll, but not hard to do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2826-mikerand","name":"mikerand","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2826_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-18T17:18:05-07:00","id":1236623,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bearman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1232782-books?p=1232822#post1232822\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">DOes anyone know if there'll be an option to buy a physical version of the 2nd ed storyteller's screen?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd love a physical screen in landscape format (hint, hint, Onyx Path <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1379-steel-rabbit","name":"Steel Rabbit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1379_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-20T03:00:02-07:00","id":1237063,"title":"","content":"I'm very interested to see how Onyx Path pulls off The Contagion Chronicle considering characters from the different splats really aren't balanced against each other. As much as I would love to have a chronicle include mages, werewolves, vampires, mummies, etc. I also know that doing so with CoD is a really bad idea. Maybe Contagion Chronicle will have rules for balancing characters from different splats? Unless the Chronicle is meant to be played where each section is limited to characters from a particular splat (the V:tR scenario is only for vampires, for example). Out of all the upcoming V:tR books, Spilled Blood is the one I'm looking forward to the most. Finally, some 2e Bloodlines.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13542-shadowdragon","name":"Shadowdragon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"205"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}